<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta continues large-scale attacks on Rohingya civilians, including a airstrike that killed four civilians, among them a five-month-old infant, in Wirathani Township, and a bridge-destruction campaign in Arakan while advancing a 108‑kilometre fence on the Bangladesh border. It has also accused ASEAN of unfairness and imbalance in its peace-plan review and criticised the bloc’s exclusion from the Manila summit. Malaysia announced it will work with the UN, OIC and ASEAN following the ICJ genocide ruling, while Myanmar admitted corruption in its conscription system and began actions against nearly 200 officials. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/europe/myanmar-genocide-icj-decision-.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/21/rohingya-who-escaped-myanmars-genocide-tell-their-stories&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Statesman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Scroll.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQeWtQUVFYLTBzdjVaY2ZqS1Y2RlJCMUxEaDRtSTRVREpuS3d3c2FGdklHNUJpZVk1Yi1vdHlUSmZNUklITFZyV1U4NXdkdndwQ2Y1cEFHMEFQTnM5TVUzTFYzbWhNVG1OZXAzTGZGa2VvajMyY0V5c0txVVJhQjBtQk1TUm9oaE51dXp4S3kzaG44bFBsN0h3MXpmaEZpdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bilyonaryo Business&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQTGluOGNLNHpiQU1kLWc1ZDVfQXN1ak5vZmkxWnVxblZrSVUtZWFMZ3JHSEV4WHI1cVBjcngtSnBGUjJ6T0lpZktzV2tL